# PySisyphus/AIMNet2-nse TS-search working directories (beckmann.ts_ml.neb) --
# ~90 intermediate files per run (per-cycle NEB trajectories, IRC checkpoints,
# optimizer logs, etc.), all regenerable by rerunning the NEB job. Only
# ts_final_hessian.h5 is ever read by code (beckmann/ts_ml/neb.py:verify_ts_ml),
# and even that's treated as regenerable working data, not a tracked result.
